  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=1,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>sinx</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<br />Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=1&#160;&#8658;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">0</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;&#8658;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">0</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> values of <math> <mrow> <mi>&#945;</mi> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;in <math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>0</mn> <mtext>,&#160;</mtext> <mn>2</mn> <mi>&#960;</mi> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math>.</p>"
